# Swift conventions

- `@MainActor` + `ObservableObject` for `TileStore`, `WorldController`, `ActivityRecorder`
- Pure math/progression as `Sendable` structs (`TileEngine`, `ProgressionEngine`)
- Route → tiles: use `tileIDsCoveringRoute` (hex line fill), not point-only sampling
- Folder-synced project: add files under `Atlasbound/`; avoid hand-editing pbxproj membership
- No new SPM/CocoaPods dependencies unless requested
- Keep Info.plist location usage strings accurate when changing recording behavior
- Region name / completion % are stubs — do not treat as real geo regions
